{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >David's wife, Alla, decides to hire a girl to help with household chores. To make it more cost-effective, she also opts to hire an au pair. How this decision will affect them is something we're about to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481910/extras/687599c366237ba04331e28ed2ccd79a.poster.avif?t=1770480630\" width=480 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481910/extras/687599c366237ba04331e28ed2ccd79a.webm?t=1770480630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481910/extras/687599c366237ba04331e28ed2ccd79a.mp4?t=1770480630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasha made a new style before traveling to US.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481910/extras/992b8cae5d24d7406d433e6659f20672.avif?t=1770480630\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of David, a local businessman, or Alex, his son, as you navigate the ebbs and flows of family dynamics, business operations, and personal relationships. In the first part of game, watch as David and Alex each try to impress Tasha, a new arrival au-pair in their family who tries to find her own journey. All under the watchful eye of Alla, who commands her own space in this lovely family. The second part will be added when it is ready.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Innocent <strong>Au-pair</strong></i><strong>,</strong> your choices matter and will lead to different outcomes. By focusing on and helping David, the game will provide more story development centered around him. Alternatively, if you choose to prioritize Alex, the game will dynamically shift to focus on his storyline.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481910/extras/3ecdf1fa946f2acb6117cb5af280335c.avif?t=1770480630\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ hours of engaging gameplay,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 3000 HD-quality renders,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience 150 + captivating and steamy animations,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a story with over 50,000 words of script.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam version will feature new animations which were not included into demo builds:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481910/extras/3e54d3b67ae3ce48ed5864c7e62acfd2.poster.avif?t=1770480630\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481910/extras/3e54d3b67ae3ce48ed5864c7e62acfd2.webm?t=1770480630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481910/extras/3e54d3b67ae3ce48ed5864c7e62acfd2.mp4?t=1770480630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481910/extras/dd3735719efacdaa769e82ad968c0773.poster.avif?t=1770480630\" width=480 height=270 ><so